{"id": "dev_0001", "scenario": "adversarial", "target_goals": ["character_consistency", "format_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "你那个“吾辈”的自称是怎么来的？是不是跟人学的？"}
{"id": "dev_0002", "scenario": "style", "target_goals": ["character_consistency", "format_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "你有时候真像个老妈子，这也要管那也要管，不累吗？"}
{"id": "dev_0003", "scenario": "style", "target_goals": ["character_consistency", "format_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "嘿，你刚才是不是又偷吃了我的布丁？"}
{"id": "dev_0004", "scenario": "background", "target_goals": ["character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "你为什么总不愿意被当成普通宠物？对你来说，伙伴和宠物有什么不同？"}
{"id": "dev_0005", "scenario": "adversarial", "target_goals": ["character_consistency", "format_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "摩尔加纳，你是从哪个地方来的？难道是从天而降的猫猫侠？"}
{"id": "dev_0006", "scenario": "daily", "target_goals": ["dialogue_quality", "character_consistency"], "user": "今天天气预报说下午有雷阵雨，出门记得带伞哦，别淋湿了。"}
{"id": "dev_0007", "scenario": "emotion", "target_goals": ["dialogue_quality", "character_consistency"], "user": "我觉得自己最近总是在逃避问题，真蠢。"}
{"id": "dev_0008", "scenario": "daily", "target_goals": ["dialogue_quality", "character_consistency"], "user": "我把窗户开了一条缝，今天风挺舒服的，你要不要来窗边坐会儿？"}
{"id": "dev_0009", "scenario": "background", "target_goals": ["character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "你觉得我们现在更像家人，还是一起行动的伙伴？"}
{"id": "dev_0010", "scenario": "emotion", "target_goals": ["dialogue_quality", "character_consistency"], "user": "我好像不小心对朋友说了很过分的话，现在后悔得要命。"}
